{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1791492996","published":"2026-10-08T20:56:47Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:12.635580998Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-63382","CVE-2026-63385"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-63382, CVE-2026-63385","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: HTTP header injection via obsolete line folding\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-63385.patch: reject any header value that\n       contains a CR or LF character in evhttp_header_is_valid_value() in\n       http.c, test/regress_http.c; backported partially: a %00 escape\n       decoded to a NUL byte by evhttp_decode_uri_internal() is still\n       accepted, as in upstream\n     - CVE-2026-63385\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: HTTP request smuggling via Transfer-Encoding handling\n     and bare-LF chunk framing\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-63382.patch: require CRLF to terminate chunk\n       size lines, reject requests with both Transfer-Encoding and\n       Content-Length or with duplicate Content-Length headers, and parse\n       every Transfer-Encoding header so that only a list ending in\n       \"chunked\" selects chunked framing in http.c, http-internal.h,\n       test/regress_http.c\n     - CVE-2026-63382","affected":[{"package":{"name":"libevent-2.1-7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libevent-2.1-7?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.1.12-stable-1+tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1791492996.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libevent-core-2.1-7","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libevent-core-2.1-7?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"2.1.12-stable-1+tuxcare.els2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1791492996.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libevent-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian: